{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>In all your dwellings.</b> Because it is an obligation on the person and not an obligation on the land, it applies in all settlements — and in tractate Kiddushin, chapter 1, it is explained why it was necessary to state this." "<b>Of bird and of animal.</b> Excludes the blood of fish and locusts (Keritot 20)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:21.897527629Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}